1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:04,500
Who dares make me leave? I'm carrying the Jiang family's heir

2
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:12,620
This is your grandson. Would you let her roam out there?

3
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:16,079
Stop pretending. At your age, how could you even get pregnant?

4
00:00:16,079 --> 00:00:21,200
We're at a hospital, how could I lie? Please, Mom, son begs you

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:24,740
I'm ruined already, but the child is the Jiang family's only heir

6
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:28,500
In my past life, I caught my husband's affair and was killed

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,740
This life, your family will pay in blood

8
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:37,880
Xiao Lan, come wash my feet. Zhang Guifang

9
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:41,520
Don't push it. Oh, my precious son says

10
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:44,980
he wants Grandma serving him personally. If she doesn't serve well

11
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:48,360
he won't come out. He'll stay in there, let's see who panics

12
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:53,460
Honey

13
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:57,440
Honey, calm down, careful with the baby

14
00:00:57,920 --> 00:01:11,510
You're only spared because you carry the Jiang heir. Sweep away... No, wrong

15
00:01:12,090 --> 00:01:16,350
Something's off. Jiang Chengao's look isn't one for a daughter-in-law

16
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:25,440
Gently, I'm carrying your heir inside. Don't press on it

